+
+**Submission write path (the story's core)**
+
+- Entry point: IP/UA extracted from the request on the validated success path only, threaded to the transaction.
+  [`application_handler.gleam:194`](../../server/src/application/application_handler.gleam#L194)
+
+- Explicit-choice validation: attested|declined required, no silent skip, UX-verbatim error copy.
+  [`application_handler.gleam:514`](../../server/src/application/application_handler.gleam#L514)
+
+- Insert-layer exhaustiveness guard: coercion would fabricate a choice, so the tx aborts loudly instead.
+  [`application_handler.gleam:1664`](../../server/src/application/application_handler.gleam#L1664)
+
+- Fourth acknowledgement write: attestation row with current policy_version, same transaction, only when attested.
+  [`application_handler.gleam:1870`](../../server/src/application/application_handler.gleam#L1870)
